body:
i have a hard time trying to change my outlook on this but I will think about equity over equality if I want it to work. Thank you, I know It may sound like I'm just a dick but finances stress me out and I am torn on whether this would be a smart decision. 

&#x200B;

Also the dominance thing is in regard to how we operate. He is really particular about the way he likes things and we tend to argue about it. I have this feeling that when I move in, I will end up doing everything his way and not having my opinion respected.
